{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Continental Congress","id":"875137859592531978","name":"liberty-hall","position":39,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica shrugs \"This system creates a representative government that is chosen by the people and seeks to keep power in check. My goal during all of this was to make sure the people have a voice, with this system I think we will. With the others that have been proposed I don't think so.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T16:06:13.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875772241353252934","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I feel like a lot have people have forgotten it was the voices of the many and not the few that have brought us here.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T16:08:52.258000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875772907652018187","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"at what point does checks and balance make the whole thing useless like the menders been saying? we get a problem, that has to go through a committee cabinet whatever the fu- and then it gets sent to the senates or whoever, and the triumvirate weighs in, after all that what good is he voice of all people, including the idiots mentioned before, if it leads to nothing?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T16:17:12.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875775006800486430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Checks. And balances. Seem like. They should be. Implementable. Rather than. Present. During every. Decision,\" Mictlan frowns, curling their fingers over the familiar metal and feathers of their familiar.","created_at":"2021-08-13T16:27:35.169000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875777617482104894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica nods \" And the solution to the idiots you've mentioned is education. Education is more freeing than what most give credit too.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T16:29:15.410000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875778037923348511","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Nolan nods in agreement with Vivica. “*Education is… freeing.*” he mimics","created_at":"2021-08-13T16:37:57.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875780227366793216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Yes, Education allows every voice to have an understanding on a matter and then the system allows us to utilize that understanding by every voice. The checks and balances really is only there as a last resort when someone tries to go too far.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T16:41:00.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875780996505690203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Kinda like the analogy I was using for another topic, this system is like a party going on a quest. There is normally multiple people in this party that want to finish the quest and make sure everyone is unharmed doing so, but still get the job done. When something happens and either a part member gets selfish or for some reasons turns, the other members are able to act and protect. Then this whole party is in check from the tavern that they go to at the end of the day that knows each of them well. When something doesn't seem right, their friends at the tavern speak up or just decide that the party is not fit to be a party and finds a new one.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T16:44:20.489000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875781834099785789","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"sounds like celebrity status\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T17:35:59.188000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875794830985400330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica is confused by this. \"What do you mean?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T17:40:52.178000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875796059874553936","reply_to_id":"875794830985400330","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"eliza's model assumes leadership is known personally by the people. it doesn't fit the size.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T17:42:13.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875796399038562425","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica thinks on this. \"With a campaign and a vote of the people the expectation would be that there is some idea of how the leaders are. Maybe the analogy isn't a perfect translation but nothing ever is.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T17:44:14.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875796907480453160","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Yeah, I suppose the my analogy has some more details that need to be added, but it does show the basis of how the system works, and how people are making sure no one steps too far.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T17:45:57.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875797338596179998","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"We should prepare for a vote tonight for or against the ratification of the constitution. We've all had time to read the proposal and sooner we get this decided the better off we'll be in ending this war.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T18:01:31.514000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T18:01:54.956000Z","id":"875801258026483722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
