{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"The flag made dwarf leans in.","created_at":"2021-08-13T23:39:08.282000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875886221069537362","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"The current matter of discussion to the court seems to be regarding whether or not Arcania should even have one centralized government at all. Pirrame, the sprite, is staunchly against a centralized government, especially one to the scale of a place as large as Arcania and many of the others seem unsure.","created_at":"2021-08-13T23:40:11.137000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T23:43:34.879000Z","id":"875886484702515221","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
