{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:10:16.712000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875894057832964116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"It's clear that Demetrius (the fey in the suit) is broadly in favor of your plan and that Sutri seems inclined to go along with him, but Ferrah, Paddy, and the twins seem hard to read and haven't said enough while you were in earshot to be clear of their position","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:12:21.438000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-14T00:13:51.406000Z","id":"875894580971720704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"The council has largely fallen silent once more, looking over copies of the proposal in various formats. The twins seem to be sharing a private joke while reading it, nodding to each other and chuckling lightly.","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:17:02.442000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875895759587905597","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Finn looks to Ferrah and gestures to the copy in front of them\n\"I've never gotten to talk much with you but have found us in many of the same places as allies. You seem to have a sound head on you from how you managed other challenges in this time. What are you hoping to see after this in the new nation we make?\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:36:19.573000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875900612947116032","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"She exhales slowly. \"I can't really say.\" She appears to be in a mild winter. \"I was never really one for liking rules or systems. None of us were. But then, well, we also ended up running a burrough on the other side.\" She sighs. \"I don't know if i'm being scared, appropriately cautious, or something else. It's good writing, but... well the court could always make writing look good too, you know?\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:42:04.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875902058220388382","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"She pauses for a few minutes. \"I like you, Finn Midask. You've got a good head on you and you know how to work a crowd. But i've seen better people fail at trying to run less and lose themselves along the way.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:43:37.419000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875902449406341120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Honestly I understand. I never thought I'd be doing this. In fact I thought I'd just be on the radio and doing all the big glam things with other celebrities and fluff material. Until this revolution picked up speed.\nI thought Eldon, Nolan or Irynx would be the main ones to be leading. \n\nI just happened to be at the right places at the right times and could provide help, get people aid, supplies, weapons.\n\nHeck now everyone has got me writing a constitution. It needs to get done, but we're running out of time. I don't even *like systems* they make me look like a cleric of law or something. I just took the grievances we had with king george, the desires of people here, and meshed it all together and tried to find a way to make it all fit.\n\nHonestly, the fey folk are some of the premier prospective supporters I want. They live the longest and will see the most effects from it. Their support could keep the honest intentions of the people and keep it from failing\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:55:11.774000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875905361742282873","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Secel inevitably finds her way here.","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:55:21.356000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875905401932107786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica waves to Secel \"Have you read through the constitution proposal?\" She will hand you a copy","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:57:05.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875905840291409920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"The.. what?\" She takes the copy and starts reading it. \"What exactly is all of this for?\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:58:10.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875906110576541716","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"A new system of government. When we win the war, we don't want someone else to come in and act as King.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:59:24.238000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875906420653064232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Ferrah smiles, and her pale blue complexion fades to a more pleasant light brown. \"Thank you, Finn Midask. I appreciate the honesty.\" She pauses for a moment. \"You're really in this now. Are you committed to fight for your beliefs and those of these people for as long as you are able? Putting your name on it's a big responsibility.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T00:59:25.928000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875906427741421639","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"So, you want someone to rule... but not be a king...\" She speaks a little slow as if she's still to wrap her head around the concept.","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:00:46.901000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875906767366783038","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Not a single person, a council of sorts. A truly representative government, something we never got from King George.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:02:18.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875907150583590963","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"The goal is to keep power in check, give a voice to the people, all people, through elections and voting.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:03:00.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875907329537769473","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Fighting red coats has always been natural. I like many others, never got a choice. This is something I believe in wholeheartedly. \n\nI don't hold faith in any religious beings, but I do hold my faith in people. People want the best for themselves *and* each other. I believe that it's the people that will see through this government that I will never get to see truly grow. I fight passionately for this because I want those after me to have their best chance at leading successful and happy lives. \"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:04:05.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875907598510063698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"So... it's a system that allows everyone to have a voice?\" She tilts her head a little.","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:04:11.357000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875907624917422120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"She smiles and nods","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:04:31.114000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875907707784294460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"If you need help reading through the constitution, I can answer your questions.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:05:17.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875907901233975347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"She nods. \"That's good enough for me.\" She moves her hand in the air with a flourish, and her signature is added to your growing collection. \"You best do right by this. A lot of people are counting on you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:05:55.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875908062706294794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"She nods, and eventually looks up again. \"How far does the laws extend? Do they incorporate all within our borders or who we consider the laws should effect?\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:07:24.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875908433176584273","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"No one is above the law, anyone within the boarders, including our elected leaders are bound by our laws but they are also entitled to the rights laid out in the bill of rights.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:09:20.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875908923067105310","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"What about sentient beings such as dragons?\" She tilts her head to the other side. \"Are they held under the same laws?\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:10:43.727000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875909270636490762","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"He looks a bit surprised but very appreciative\n\"Tha-thank you.\" he nods in affirmation\n\n\"I'm not sure if I'd be able to reach to Piramme on this. The twins already know of my character when they tested me I know we shared many connections and aid in the past several weeks.\n\nI haven't had the chance to meet Paddy, would you be able to introduce the two of us? My intention isn't to come to impart my ideals to them but primarily to hear the concerns and see where the document may be changed or clarified\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:14:13.375000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-14T01:14:17.802000Z","id":"875910149963923537","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"If a Dragon chooses to participate as an equal in our new nation they will be, yes. Thays a question I haven't had posed yet.\" She thinks \"We say the same thing for higher beings like gods, but often times Dragons don't tend to not concern themselves with government or matters of humanoids. They definitely can choose to though.\"","created_at":"2021-08-14T01:15:18.382000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875910422623039528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"875137859592531978","created_at":"2021-08-13T07:45:22.657000Z","id":"875646199401697310","name":"Liberty Hall in the Stands"},"thread_id":"875646199401697310"}
